{title: Wada Raha Sanam}
{artist: Khiladi Abhijeet Alka Yagnik Jatin Lalit}
{key: Dm}

{c: Verse 1}
[Dm]Waada [F]raha sanam
[F]honge juda [G]na hum
[G]Chaahe [Dm]na [C]chaahe zamana
[C]Hamari chahaton ka
[C]mit [G]na [Dm]sakega fasana
[Dm]Hamari [C]chahaton ka
[C]mit [G]na [Dm]sakega fasana
[Dm]In vaadiyon [G]mein yoon hi
[G]milte [C]rahenge
[G]Dil mein wafa ke diye
[G]jalte [C]rahenge
[C]Yeh [F]manga hai [G]duaon mein
[G]Kami na [C]ho wafaon mein
[C]Rahein [F]teri [G]nigahon mein
[G]Likho [C]na yeh [Gm]fizaon mein [F]o saajna
[C]Hamari chahaton ka
[C]mit [G]na [Dm]sakega fasana
[Dm]Hamari [C]chahaton ka
[C]mit [G]na [Dm]sakega fasana
[Dm]Kaisi [G]udasi tere
[G]chehre [C]pe chhayi
[G]Kya baat hai jo teri
[G]aankh [C]bhar aai
[C]Dekho [F]to kya [G]nazaare hain
[G]Tumhari tarah [C]pyare hain
[C]Hanso [F]na mere [G]liye tum
[G]Sabhi to [C]ye tumhare [Gm]hai o [F]jaane jaan
[C]Hamari chahaton ka
[C]mit [G]na [Dm]sakega fasana
